From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Glasswave <glasswave@local>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:39:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] lyrics: request l[script]=en-Latn and parse TTML localization
 tracks

Request l[script]=en-Latn alongside extend=ttmlLocalizations so Apple Music
returns official <transliterations> pronunciation tracks (e.g. ja-Latn,
zh-Latn-pinyin) alongside <translations>. Prefer ttmlLocalizations when
present, apply locale-matched type=replacement blocks directly onto the
main line (preserving timed <span> syllables), fix the inverted
translation/original order and relative .// lookup in etree, emit explicit
[gw:tr] and [gw:ro] sidecar lines without discarding CJK originals, and
preserve syllable timing on pronunciation spans.

